# Text files detected and checked out with LF on every machine, Windows included: development is
# on Linux, and a run record hashes a test file's bytes as they stand on disk (docs/questions.md Q46).
* text=auto eol=lf
# The supervision page's sources and build checked out with LF on every machine, so a rebuild on
# Windows writes the committed page byte for byte (vite keeps a CR of a CRLF source in index.html).
crates/veredas-supervisao/web/** eol=lf
# Binary formats, never normalised: the workbooks Ábaco reads and the engine's compiled tables.
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.bin binary
